## SQ-BBQS-01 | skewering inputs are skewering/* tags; kebab sandwich takes grilled_skewers; no item-input warnings
@group A
@commands Boot; grep `logs/kubejs/server.log` for `bbqSkewering\|bbqCombine\|skewering/` warnings; recipe dump `creativedelight:skewering/raw_potato_skewer`, `raw_beef_skewer`, `creativedelight:shapeless/kebab_sandwich`
@pass potato ingredient `{"tag":"creativedelight:skewering/potato"}` count 2, side `{"tag":"creativedelight:skewering/bacon"}`; beef `skewering/beef` + `skewering/cabbage`; sandwich has 2 `{"tag":"barbequesdelight:grilled_skewers"}` slots; tag dump `#creativedelight:skewering/potato` = potato, sweet potato
@fails an `{"item":...}` input = `Item.of(tag, n)` still in `recipes.js`; unknown dict key `t_skewering_*` (startup scripts not reloaded)
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
kjsreject (bbqSkewering|bbqCombine).*(warn|WARN|unknown|Unknown)
shell grep -nE "bbqSkewering|bbqCombine|skewering/" logs/kubejs/server.log | head -10 | cut -c1-240; true
> zq rdetail creativedelight:skewering/raw_potato_skewer
> zq rdetail creativedelight:skewering/raw_beef_skewer
> zq rdetail kebab_sandwich
> zq itemtag creativedelight:skewering/potato
> zq itemtag creativedelight:skewering/bacon
> zq itemtag creativedelight:skewering/beef
> zq itemtag creativedelight:skewering/cabbage
waitlog itemtag creativedelight:skewering/cabbage 20
expect itemtag creativedelight:skewering/potato \(2\): .*minecraft:potato
expect itemtag creativedelight:skewering/potato \(2\): .*veggiesdelight:sweet_potato
look raw_potato_skewer inputs = the potato tag's items (potato/sweet_potato) and the bacon tag's items; beef = beef tag + cabbage tag items; kebab sandwich (shaped _manual_only and the sequenced assembly; row named shapeless/kebab_sandwich, id now shaped/kebab_sandwich_manual_only) has two inputs listing the grilled skewers. Ingredient count 2 on the potato: rdetail+ fields line if shown, else judge in JEI (CQ-BBQS-01)

## SQ-BBQS-02 | basin well with 2 sweet potatoes, stick in hand, bacon in off hand: raw potato skewer
@group A
@commands Fake player: basin well with 2 `veggiesdelight:sweet_potato`, main hand stick, off hand 2 bacon, right click the well
@pass Raw Potato Skewer given; well empty; one stick and the bacon used
@fails no recipe match: tag empty or ingredient JSON
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
> setblock 300 -60 350 barbequesdelight:basin[facing=north]{Items:{Items:[{Slot:0,id:"veggiesdelight:sweet_potato",Count:2b}]}}
> zc2 inv 300 -60 350
> pbot hold c2b minecraft:stick 1
> item replace entity c2b weapon.offhand with farmersdelight:bacon 2
> zc2 useat c2b 300 -60 350 0.75 0.2 0.5 up
sleep 1
> zc2 inv 300 -60 350
> zp inv c2b
waitlog \[zp\] done 20
expect \[zp\] inv c2b: .*barbequesdelight:raw_potato_skewer
look first basin inv shows 0:2 veggiesdelight:sweet_potato (else the Items NBT shape is wrong: BATCH-FAULT); after the use: well 0 empty, raw potato skewer in the inventory or main hand, stick gone (main now empty or the skewer), bacon in the off hand down by one (off now 1 farmersdelight:bacon). Hit x 0.75 is well 0 for facing=north (BlockSlot index = 1 - x)
> clear c2b

## SQ-BBQS-03 | sneaking use with a stick on a well of 4 cabbage takes one cabbage, keeps the stick
@group A
@commands Fake player sneaking, main hand stick, well holding 4 cabbage: use on the well
@pass 3 cabbage left; cabbage in the inventory; stick still in hand
@fails `onSneakGrab` not registered (BarbequesDelight ctor)
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
> setblock 302 -60 350 barbequesdelight:basin[facing=north]{Items:{Items:[{Slot:0,id:"farmersdelight:cabbage",Count:4b}]}}
> pbot hold c2b minecraft:stick 1
> zp sneak c2b on
> zc2 useat c2b 302 -60 350 0.75 0.2 0.5 up
sleep 1
> zp sneak c2b off
> zc2 inv 302 -60 350
> zp inv c2b
waitlog \[zp\] done 20
expect \[zc2\] inv 302 -60 350: .*0:3 farmersdelight:cabbage
expect \[zp\] inv c2b: .*farmersdelight:cabbage
expect \[zp\] inv c2b: .*minecraft:stick
look the useat line: main stays 1 minecraft:stick; one cabbage in the inventory
> clear c2b

